  "summary": "Malicious code in slotozen-casino (npm)",
  "details": "Slotozen-casino@1.0.0 is an inert spam package: its only code is an empty module (module.exports = {}), with no install scripts, no dependencies, and no executable behaviour. It ships a README containing casino-affiliate SEO content promoting slotozencasino[.]net and slotozen8[.]com (a \"Slotozen Casino\" review with an external image hosted on i[.]ibb[.]co). The package performs no network activity, reads no credentials, and contains no payload; it is a content-only placeholder published under a casino-review name.",
